  "summary": "Rubber Ducky is a terminal tool that turns natural-language prompts into shell commands via Ollama (local or cloud), with an interactive REPL, single-shot mode, piped input, saved 'crumb' shortcuts, and state stored under ~/.ducky/. Evidence is README documentation plus a requirements.txt listing 'ollama'; development setup uses uv and ruff.",
